@HostAddress = https://localhost:7205

### Ticket 1 - all books (check pageCount)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/books
Accept: application/json

### Ticket 1 - one book
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/books/1
Accept: application/json

### Ticket 2 - books of author 1 (check authorFullName)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/books/by-author/1
Accept: application/json

### Ticket 3 - create a book (check the id you get back)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Burmese Days",
  "isbn": "9780156148504",
  "year": 1934,
  "pageCount": 300,
  "genre": 1,
  "authorId": 1
}

### Ticket 4 - update book 1, then GET it again
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Nineteen Eighty-Four",
  "isbn": "9780451524935",
  "year": 1949,
  "pageCount": 328,
  "genre": 1
}

### Ticket 5 (bonus) - books published in 1949 or later
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/books?minYear=1949
Accept: application/json

### Delete a book
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/books/9
